entries[78846] = { ["name"] = "Necrotic Boneplate Shoulderguards", ["text"] = "Raid Finder\nBinds when picked up\nShoulder Plate\n11 Armor\n+0 [Strength or Intellect]\n+5 Stamina\n- -1 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Mastery\n\nPrismatic Socket\nPrismatic Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 3 Mastery\n\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Death Knight\nNecrotic Boneplate Armor (0/5)\nNecrotic Boneplate Chestguard\nNecrotic Boneplate Handguards\nNecrotic Boneplate Faceguard\nNecrotic Boneplate Legguards\nNecrotic Boneplate Shoulderguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set : When an attack drops your health below 35%, one of your Blood Runes will immediately activate and convert into a Death Rune for the next until canceled. This effect cannot occur more than once every 45 sec. (45s cooldown)\n(4) Set : Your Vampiric Blood ability also affects all party and raid members for 50% of the effect it has on you.\nSell Price:" }
